{
  "basis": "The policy requires submitting dates where the combined station traffic (sum of Station X, Y, and Z) exceeds 4,500. The chart displays this combined traffic as the top of the stacked bars. Visually, the stack tops for both Tuesday and Wednesday are positioned above the 4,500 gridline, while the tops for Thursday and Monday are below it. Therefore, both Tuesday and Wednesday meet the criteria for the crowding alert.",
  "option_label": "Submit Tue and Wed for transit crowding alert"
}
